{"id":"n28162-3-8","stage":2,"title":"크림 · 奶油","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28162-3-8-1","ko":"빵 안에 뭐가 들었어?","zh":"面包里面放了什么？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"빵","meaning":"面包","explanation":"빵：面包","readings":[{"term":"빵","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23402","senseId":"1","lemma":"빵","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안에","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"뭐가","meaning":"什么","explanation":"뭐：什么；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"1","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들었어?","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"edc73c627b8f32b7","term":"빵","zh":"面包","audio":"/audio/edc73c627b8f32b7f6a1.mp3","entryId":"23402","definition":"将面粉揉和并使之发酵后，蒸或烤而成的食物。","pronunciation":["빵"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"指代不知道的事实或事物。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d8934cdfd9c54662d85a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28162-3-8-2","ko":"하얀 크림이 들어 있어서 달고 맛있어.","zh":"里面含有白色奶油，所以又甜又好吃。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"하얀","meaning":"白","explanation":"하얗다：白；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하얗다","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73274","senseId":"1","lemma":"하얗다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"크림이","meaning":"奶油","explanation":"크림：奶油；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"크림","audio":"/audio/048ca4a327aba411fae7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28162","senseId":"3","lemma":"크림","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어","meaning":"包含，含有","explanation":"들다：包含，含有；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"들다","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71686","senseId":"9","lemma":"들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어서","meaning":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","explanation":"있다：某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"3","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달고","meaning":"甜，甘甜","explanation":"달다：甜，甘甜；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"달다","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62741","senseId":"1","lemma":"달다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛있어.","meaning":"好吃，可口，香","explanation":"맛있다：好吃，可口，香；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"맛있다","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70811","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"77a80be38f1ae80d","term":"하얗다","zh":"白","audio":"/audio/77a80be38f1ae80d931c.mp3","entryId":"73274","definition":"和雪或牛奶一样白得鲜明。","pronunciation":["하ː야타"]},{"id":"048ca4a327aba411","term":"크림","zh":"奶油","audio":"/audio/048ca4a327aba411fae7.mp3","entryId":"28162","definition":"用鸡蛋、牛奶、白糖等制成的淡黄色或白色的黏性食品。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"7ff37822e89462ea","term":"들다","zh":"包含，含有","audio":"/audio/7ff37822e89462ea5014.mp3","entryId":"71686","definition":"装在里面或组成一部分。","pronunciation":["들다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"某种结果状态持续着（-아/어 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"bb552fc456991067","term":"달다","zh":"甜，甘甜","audio":"/audio/bb552fc45699106762e3.mp3","entryId":"62741","definition":"与蜂蜜或糖的味道相似。","pronunciation":["달다"]},{"id":"21e91ac8a208ff9e","term":"맛있다","zh":"好吃，可口，香","audio":"/audio/21e91ac8a208ff9e520a.mp3","entryId":"70811","definition":"食物的味道好。","pronunciation":["마딛따","마싣따"]}],"audio":"/audio/a79335c7a0f6808cf1e5.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.398,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28162","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"중급","day":79,"sequenceScore":2.2247,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["里面含有白色奶油，所以又甜又好吃。","敏俊穿西装真合适啊。","面包里面放了什么？"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["里面含有白色奶油，所以又甜又好吃。","面包里面放了什么？","敏俊穿西装真合适啊。"],"answer":0}]}
